Prism Themes
============

This extension contains:

1. Ported UI palettes (61 semantic OKLCH keys per family, converted to sRGB
   hex) for the themes T3 Chat, Grove, Ocean, Ember and Iris — each in light
   and dark variants. Source: the T3 Code project
   https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code (packages/shared/src/themePalettes.ts),
